 "notes": "Promoted 2026-10-27. Ran the official v1.16.0 image binary (volcanosh/vc-scheduler@sha256:157578510d406c7390419dec97e81c5797969231022be39eb92e81feee0bbd71, extracted /vc-scheduler, --version 41f27d567fb5bdaf2cab01e1caaf48f7e266eefb) inside the QEMU k3s VM. Negative control without --enable-pprof: debug port closed. With --enable-pprof --listen-address=0.0.0.0:18083: /debug/pprof/ and /debug/pprof/heap returned 200 without authentication, listener on all interfaces and reachable via eth0. The scheduler serves the debug mux while leader election retries; CRDs were applied first."
